  "description": "<p>⭐ <em>Ranked as one of London's best comedy clubs by the Mirror and Evening Standard, Soho Comedy House brings you a stellar lineup of UK comedy stars and the talent of tomorrow.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n😂 Enjoy a night of live comedy with an always amazing lineup of top-tier comedians.<br>\r\n✨ Previous performers have been seen on Taskmaster, Live at the Apollo, 8 out of 10 Cats, and more.<br>\r\n🎤 Free Karaoke all night long—be your own DJ, play your own music, and dance before and after the show.<br>\r\n🍹 Incredible all-night drink prices including £10 Cocktails/Doubles, £6 Beers, and £5 Shots.<br>\r\n💓 Located at the iconic 30 Dean Street, right in the heart of Central London's Soho.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date and time: choose in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: approx. 2 hours<br>\r\n📍 Location: Soho Comedy House<br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: 18+ with valid ID<br>\r\n❓ Please note: seating is unreserved. We recommend arriving early to secure your spot and grab a drink from the bar<br>\r\n⚠️ Late entry: if you arrive after the start time, you may risk losing your seat</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nSoho Comedy House is London’s premier destination for laughs, running every single night of the week at the vibrant 30 Dean Street Bar &amp; Club. Whether you're looking to catch established TV stars or discover the next big thing, our stage is home to the very best of the UK comedy circuit. But the fun doesn't stop at the punchlines—stay for the free karaoke, take control of the playlist as your own DJ, and enjoy Soho's best drink deals all night long. It’s the perfect blend of high-energy comedy and a late-night party atmosphere. Grab your tickets and get ready for an unforgettable night in the heart of the West End!</p>",
